    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grimes Clontarf are delighted to bring this bright and welcoming dual aspect apartment to the market. Number  18 Parker House is a 1 bed (plus study) top floor apartment located in a sought after development in Baldoyle. \r\n\r\nBuilt in 2006, No. 18 provides approx. 60 sq m / 645 sq ft of light-filled and comfortable living and bedroom accommodation. Internally the property is well-presented and bright, and comprises in brief an entrance hall, bathroom, living / dining / kitchen, double bedroom and study. The property is further complimented by designated parking in the underground car park. \r\n\r\nSituated in Baldoyle in a quiet and residential location, easily accessible from the Coast Road, Grange Road and the M50. Clongriffin DART station is a five minute walk and there are numerous bus routes that service the area providing efficient links to the City Centre. There is a choice of shops, supermarkets and leisure amenities that include coastal walks, Father Collins Park and various sports clubs. There are also highly regarded primary and secondary schools in the area. The property is within close proximity to Portmarnock, Howth, Sutton and Malahide and also benefits from easy access to the Port Tunnel, M1 and Dublin Airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\r\nWide hallway complete with carpet flooring and utility press with washing machine\r\n\t\r\nLiving / Dining Room / Kitchen:\r\nLarge open plan room with large windows allowing for an abundance of natural light. Ample living and dining space Kitchen with tiled flooring. fitted with an array of wall and floor units, with integrated oven, hob and extractor fan and fridge freezer\r\n\r\nBedroom:\r\nSpacious and bright double room to the rear with a soft carpeted floor and convenient built-in wardrobes \r\n\r\nStudy:\r\nSituated to the rear with built-in wardrobe. In use as a bedroom\r\n\r\nBathroom: \r\nPart tiled with WC, wash hand basin and a bath with a convenient shower attachment\r\n\r\nServices:\r\nOne surface designated car parking space\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\n\r\nManagement Company:\r\nReville Property Management\r\n \r\nManagement Fee:\r\nApprox. €2,207.82 per annum (subject to change) \r\n\r\nBER Details:\r\nBER: C\r\nBER No: 119825735\r\n\r\nContents:\r\nCarpets, curtains, blinds, light fittings, fixtures and fittings\r\nIntegrated and non-integrated appliances"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
